---
title: Pho Bo
cooklang: 2
servings: 4
cuisine: Vietnamese
source: recipe-pack dinner-6/6237-vietnamese-pho-bo-2
---

= Broth -> broth

`Blanch` @beef bones{1%kg}(marrow and knuckle) in a large #stockpot{} covered with @-water{3%l}:
`bring` to a boil and `boil` for ~{5%minutes}. `Drain` and `rinse` the @&beef bones{} under cold
water.

`Char` @onion{1}(halved) and @ginger{100%g}(halved) on a #tray{} under the #broiler{} until ~{blackened}, ~{5-7%minutes}.

`Return` the @&beef bones{} to the #&stockpot{} with @beef brisket{450%g}, the @&onion{}, the
@&ginger{}, @star anise{4}, @cinnamon stick{1}, @cloves{4} and @coriander seeds{1%tbsp}.
`Pour in` @water{2.5%l} and `bring` to a boil.

`Simmer` for ~{3%hours}, skimming the foam. -> broth

`Remove` the @&beef brisket{} to a #board{} and `slice` it thinly. -> sliced brisket

`Season` the @&broth{} with @fish sauce{1%tbsp}, @rock sugar{1%tbsp} and @salt{}, `simmer` for
~{30%minutes}, then `discard` the @&beef bones{}.

= Noodles and toppings

`Cook` @rice noodles{450%g} in a #pot{} of @-water{2%l} according to the packet, then `drain`.
-> noodles

`Slice` @beef sirloin{225%g} thinly against the grain on a #+board{}. -> raw beef

= Assemble -> pho

`Divide` the @&noodles{} among four #bowls{} and `top` the #&bowls{} with the @&raw beef{}, the
@&sliced brisket{}, @green onions{3}(thinly sliced) and @cilantro{10%g}(chopped).

`Bring rolling boil` the @&broth{} to a rolling boil and `ladle` the @&broth{} over the @&noodles{} in the
#&bowls{}.

`Serve` with @?Thai basil{}, @?mint{}, @?bean sprouts{}, @?lime{}(wedges), @?red chilies{}(sliced),
@?hoisin sauce{} and @?Sriracha{} on the side.
